      "short_description": "Janus Henderson Investors is a global asset management firm based in London, formed in 2017 from the merger of Janus Capital and Henderson Group. The company manages approximately $350\u2013380 billion in assets, focusing on active management across various investment strategies, including equities, fixed income, multi-asset solutions, and alternatives. \n\nWith roots dating back to 1934, Janus Henderson has a rich history in investment management. It serves a diverse clientele, including individuals, financial advisors, and institutional investors worldwide. The firm emphasizes high-conviction strategies and offers a wide range of investment products, such as mutual funds, investment trusts, and ETFs. Recent developments include partnerships and acquisitions that enhance its capabilities in private credit and emerging markets. Janus Henderson operates with a dedicated team of investment professionals across multiple global offices.",
